{"availability":"available","full":"PRITHIVSAKTHIUR/SAM3-Demo","name":"SAM3-Demo","description":"SAM3: Segment Anything Model 3 is an experimental, multi-functional computer vision application that provides a unified interface for text-conditioned and click-interactive segmentation. Built around Meta's advanced facebook/sam3 multi-model architecture.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":16,"forks":4,"created":"2025-11-20T11:35:29Z","updated":"2026-05-23T02:37:27Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/prithivMLmods/SAM3-Demo","topics":["accelerate","facebook","gradio","huggingface-spaces","huggingface-transformers","imageio","imageio-plugin","metaai","numpy","opencv-python","peft","pillow","python","pytorch","sam3","segment-anything","segmentation-models","torch","torchvision"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/prithivMLmods/SAM3-Demo","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:32:13.832Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:32:13.832Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:32:13.832Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:12:26.158Z","stars":16,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:13.832Z","stars":16,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SAM3: Segment Anything Model 3 is an experimental, multi-functional computer vision application that provides a unified interface for text-conditioned and click-interactive segmentation. Built around Meta's advanced facebook/sam3 multi-model architecture, this application seamlessly features separate pipelines optimized for text-to-image segmentation, multi-frame video propagation, and high-speed, point-cumulative image tracking. The suite leverages specialized model variants (Sam3Model, Sam3VideoModel, and Sam3TrackerModel) to support highly precise masks over custom objects, bounding boxes,…"],"features":["Text-Conditional Image Segmentation: Instantly isolates target objects inside static images by matching custom queries (e.g., \"cat\", \"face\", \"car wheel\") against SAM3 instance maps, complete with custom threshold…","Temporal Video Object Propagation: Tracks and cuts targeted entities dynamically across successive video frames. By incorporating bfloat16 numerical computation, the video pipeline scales smoothly inside active VRAM…","Interactive Point Tracking: Allows users to interactively click directly on a live input canvas. The model processes each cursor selection as a positive foreground anchor and updates the colored mask overlays instantly.","Bespolke Gradio Workspace: Features an elegant, three-tab layout powered by the Gradio theme engine, integrating clean file-drop inputs, real-time tracking logs, and automated example sets.","Supervision and Matplotlib Styling: Implements structural contour draws and randomized colormap overlays over generated masks to ensure clear human validation on complex textures."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PRITHIVSAKTHIUR/SAM3-Demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b56daddb6d97bcdc0fcf759ed64fb6882ffdc232b0266632d07449533a02ac61","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T06:12:26.338Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T06:12:26.338Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"SAM3: Segment Anything Model 3 is an experimental, multi-functional computer vision application that provides a unified interface for text-conditioned and click-interactive segmentation. Built around Meta's advanced facebook/sam3 multi-model architecture, this application seamlessly features separate pipelines optimized for text-to-image segmentation, multi-frame video propagation, and high-speed, point-cumulative image tracking. The suite leverages specialized model variants (Sam3Model, Sam3VideoModel, and Sam3TrackerModel) to support highly precise masks over custom objects, bounding boxes,…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PRITHIVSAKTHIUR/SAM3-Demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b56daddb6d97bcdc0fcf759ed64fb6882ffdc232b0266632d0